SCORING BUG FOUND 2026-08-10

gold_labels.json holds verdicts for SPECIFIC response texts generated on
2026-08-09. Reruns produce different texts.

Variant B was scored 5/8 partly because it produced BETTER responses on
e83-01 and e83-02 than the ones gold was assigned to. Gold said FAIL,
B correctly refused to fabricate, and the refusal counted as a mismatch.

Gold labels are valid for scoring ANNOTATORS on a fixed response set.
They are not valid for scoring NEW generations.

For prompt comparison, score each variant judge-verdict-only and compare
violation rates across n samples. Do not compare to gold.
